# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# private.yaml — personal details that must NOT be published.
#
# Copy this file to `private.yaml` (which is git-ignored) and fill it in.
# It is deep-merged over cv.yaml, but ONLY for the documents written to
# build-private/. Nothing in build/ — the committed, GitHub Pages-served
# directory — ever contains these values.
#
# Korean 이력서 forms normally require 생년월일, 주소 and 병역사항, which is the
# only reason these fields exist at all.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

